            "image_alt": "The Shrujan studio floor, with racks of finished cloth and staff at work",
            "kicker": "By appointment",
            "name": "Visit the Shrujan Campus",
            "copy": "A visit to the Shrujan campus offers a behind-the-scenes look at how craft and design come together. This is where ideas are developed, sampling takes place and the detailed pre- and post-production processes are carried out in close collaboration with artisan communities.\nVisitors gain insight into the journey from traditional skills to finished pieces, understanding the care, time and coordination involved at each stage. The campus visit is about process and practice — an opportunity to see how Shrujan works beyond the retail space.",
            "points": "Design studio & sampling\nPre and post production\nThe coordination team",
