            "kicker": "Any time in season",
            "name": "Visit Kutch",
            "copy": "Kutch is a land of vast landscapes, living traditions and quiet beauty. A journey here is shaped as much by the people you meet as by the places you see. Craft, music, food and everyday life are deeply connected, offering a glimpse into cultures that continue to evolve while remaining rooted.\nThrough thoughtfully designed journeys, visitors can explore Kutch in a way that goes beyond sightseeing — spending time with artisan communities, understanding their environments and experiencing the region at a slower pace. For many, the journey becomes not only a travel experience but a personal one.",
            "points": "Craft villages & workshops\nThe LLDC museum\nPalaces, port towns, the Rann",
            "cta_label": "Plan Your Trip",
            "cta_link": "tel:+919099974319"
          }
